{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/welcome_to_cb4_en.png?t=1749194460\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Cozy Beach, where you can fish on a cozy tropical island and hang out with your feline friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude38\u00a0Customize an adorable avatar and dress them up with lots of stylish options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa3 Go fishing and try to collect everything in your fish tracking journal. Some fish are sneaky and might take a couple players to catch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/fishing_long.gif?t=1749194460\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc1f Swim around in an inner tube to explore the waters around the island to find the best fishing spot.\u00a0 Some fishing areas are particularly productive, and some lucky areas have rarer fish than others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/swimming.gif?t=1749194460\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd88 Trade for fishing supplies with a totally bodacious trio of shark siblings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd2a\u00a0React with emotes - jump for joy to celebrate a catch, or cry about the one that got away.\u00a0 You can use emotes to communicate with other players too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0e Discover treasure maps and hunt for treasure- what kind of cool  stuff will you find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf4d Collect fruits, and craft fun and silly tropical drinks from the friendly capybara barkeeper - the rarer the ingredients, the more exotic the drink!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb6 Jam out to sweet tunes on the radio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/emotes.gif?t=1749194460\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And of course, no day at the beach is complete without hanging out and chatting with your friends in multiplayer \ud83d\udc6f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy Beach can be played co-op locally, or online with others. Join up with other players to get 100% completion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game will have Steam deck compatibility- so you can hang out on the beach, wherever you are! \ud83c\udfdd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist Cozy Beach today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/drink-bar.png?t=1749194460\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3489070?t=1749194460","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749194460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/9b4d8d04d72be950d99814a8b3a4ea607a5dff8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749194460","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/9b4d8d04d72be950d99814a8b3a4ea607a5dff8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749194460","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"R