\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf4d Collect fruits, and craft fun and silly tropical drinks from the friendly capybara barkeeper - the rarer the ingredients, the more exotic the drink!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb6 Jam out to sweet tunes on the radio!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/emotes.gif?t=1749194460\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And of course, no day at the beach is complete without hanging out and chatting with your friends in multiplayer \ud83d\udc6f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy Beach can be played co-op locally, or online with others. Join up with other players to get 100% completion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game will have Steam deck compatibility- so you can hang out on the beach, wherever you are! \ud83c\udfdd</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wishlist Cozy Beach today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/extras/drink-bar.png?t=1749194460\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["LunaBeat"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489070/5f0a072db15d4b81e0af8e02aaaa704480d915c0/header.jpg?t=1749194460","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257095113,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095113/movie480.mp4?t=1748490221","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095113/movie_max.mp4?t=1748490221"},"name":"Steam page announce trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.st